From 150b6ee40b269d68d54e1d14a7e946211b9169f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 06:41:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Three new technique rows in the engine: ten elements,
 techniques 122 to 145 with their own learned bits, effects, names and save
 layout 2

